  "All protocols and specifications on this site are versioned research drafts (currently v0.1). They are not official standards, have not been adopted by any standards body, and may change without notice.": "Bu sahypadaky ähli protokollar we spesifikasiýalar wersiýalaşdyrylan barlag taslamalarydyr (häzirki wagtda v0.1). Olar resmi standartlar däl, hiç bir standart edarasy tarapyndan kabul edilmedik, we duýduryşsyz üýtgäp biler.",
  "All specs": "Ähli spesifikasiýalar",
