  "An experiment in AI/agent governance: this site is itself a working example": "Emeli intellekt/agent dolandyryşynda synag: bu sahypa özi işleýän mysaldyr",
  "Answer \"may AI learn from this?\" with dimension-level precision instead of a crawl bit.": "„Emeli intellekt munuň esasynda öwrenip bilermi?” diýen soraga bir gözleg biti bilen däl-de, ölçeg derejesindäki takyklyk bilen jogap beriň.",
  "Anthropic’s interpretability team identified internal \"emotion vectors\" in Claude Sonnet 4.5 that activate in contextually appropriate situations and causally shape behavior — for instance, amplifying a \"desperate\" vector increased blackmail-like responses, while boosting \"calm\" reduced them. The team stresses this shows functional, behavior-shaping emotion states, not evidence of subjective feeling.": "Anthropicyň düşündiriş topary Claude Sonnet 4.5-de kontekste laýyk ýagdaýlarda işjeňleşýän we hereketi sebäp-netije taýdan şekillendirýän içki „duýgy wektorlaryny” anyklady — mysal üçin, „umytsyzlyk” wektoryny güýçlendirmek şantaž ýaly jogaplary artdyrdy, „parahatlyk” wektoryny güýçlendirmek bolsa olary azaltdy. Topar munuň subýektiw duýgynyň subutnamasy däl-de, funksional, hereketi şekillendirýän duýgy ýagdaýlaryny görkezýändigini nygtaýar.",
  "Architecting Trust in Artificial Epistemic Agents": "Architecting Trust in Artificial Epistemic Agents",
  "Argues that ontology — once dismissed as impractical — has become load-bearing infrastructure for AI reliability: large language model hallucination exposed a missing layer of \"meaning,\" and pragmatic, embedded ontologies now function as guardrails that anchor probabilistic output to accountable action.": "Bir wagtlar amaly däl diýlip ret edilen ontologiýanyň, häzir emeli intellektiň ygtybarlylygy üçin ýük göterýän infrastruktura öwrülendigini öňe sürýär: uly dil modelleriniň hallýusinasiýasy „many” gatlagynyň ýoklugyny äşgär etdi, we pragmatik, gömülen ontologiýalar häzir ähtimallyk esasly çykyşy jogapkärçilikli hereket bilen baglanyşdyrýan gorag germewleri hökmünde işleýär.",
  "Artificial Intelligence and Legal Personhood: Ethical, Regulatory, and Accountability Challenges in Contemporary Jurisprudence": "Artificial Intelligence and Legal Personhood: Ethical, Regulatory, and Accountability Challenges in Contemporary Jurisprudence",
  "Artificial Persons": "Emeli Şahslar",
  "At the UN’s inaugural Global Dialogue on AI Governance in Geneva, Secretary-General António Guterres called for coordinated worldwide rules covering everything from child-safety obligations on AI developers to limits on unsafe autonomous weapons, warning that unchecked AI could deepen inequality between rich and poor nations.": "BMG-niň Ženewada geçirilen ilkinji Emeli Intellekt Dolandyryşy Boýunça Ählumumy Dialogynda Baş sekretar António Guterres, emeli intellekt döredijileriniň çaga howpsuzlygy boýunça borçlaryndan başlap, howply awtonom ýaraglara çäklendirmelere çenli ähli zady öz içine alýan utgaşdyrylan dünýä kadalaryna çagyryş etdi, we gözegçiliksiz emeli intellektiň baý we garyp ýurtlaryň arasyndaky deňsizligi çuňlaşdyryp biljekdigi barada duýduryş berdi.",
