  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Bletchley Emeli Intellekt Howpsuzlygy Sammitinden soň sargyt edilen we Yoshua Bengionyň ýolbaşçylygynda, takmynan 30 ýurtdan we BMG, OECD, EI-den 100-den gowrak hünärmeniň goşant goşan bu garaşsyz hasabaty, öňdebaryjy emeli intellektiň mümkinçilikleri we töwekgelçilikleri barada häzirki ylmy subutnamalary jemleýär — käbir ulgamlaryň indi özleriniň bahalandyrylýandygyny anyklap, degişlilikde hereketini üýtgedip biljekdigini belleýär.",
