  "Corrected an earlier default: Belgium (BE) now maps to Dutch instead of French — Flemish speakers are the country’s majority (~60%) over Walloon French speakers (~40%).": "Ozalky standart sazlama düzedildi: Belgiýa (BE) indi fransuz diliniň deregine golland diline gabat gelýär — flamand dilinde gepleýänler ýurduň köplügini düzýär (~60%), walloniýaly fransuz dilinde gepleýänlerden (~40%) has köp.",
  "Corrected an earlier default: Kazakhstan (KZ) now maps to Kazakh instead of Russian, now that a Kazakh translation exists — the same kind of fix as the earlier Belgium correction.": "Ozalky standart sazlama düzedildi: gazak dilindäki terjime bar bolansoň, Gazagystan (KZ) indi rus diliniň deregine gazak diline gabat gelýär — bu ozalky Belgiýa düzedişi bilen meňzeş görnüşdäki düzedişdir.",
