  "Five more interface languages: Tamil, Czech, Ukrainian, Malay, and Finnish — 30 languages total, three-quarters of the way through the full language list.": "Ýene bäş interfeýs dili: tamil, çeh, ukrain, malaý we fin — jemi 30 dil, doly dil sanawynyň dörtden üçüne ýetildi.",
  "Five more languages beyond the original 40-language list: Punjabi, Telugu, Marathi, Amharic, and Burmese — 45 languages total. This is the start of an ongoing daily cadence, not a fixed list this time; languages are now picked for population and geographic reach as the site works toward full global coverage.": "Asyl 40 dilli sanawdan aňyrda ýene bäş dil: pandžabi, telugu, marathi, amhar we birma dilleri — jemi 45 dil. Bu, bu gezek berk sanaw däl-de, dowamly gündelik depginiň başlangyjydyr; sahypa doly ählumumy gerimlik ugrunda işlän wagty diller ilat sany we geografiki gerim boýunça saýlanýar.",
  "Five more languages: Nepali, Sinhala, Uzbek, Hausa, and Azerbaijani — 50 languages total. Second batch under the daily cadence, again picked for population and geographic reach (South Asia, Central Asia, the Caucasus, and West Africa).": "Ýene bäş dil: nepal, sinhala, özbek, hausa we azerbaýjan dilleri — jemi 50 dil. Gündelik depginiň astyndaky ikinji topar, ýene-de ilat sany we geografiki gerim boýunça saýlanan (Günorta Aziýa, Merkezi Aziýa, Kawkaz we Günbatar Afrika).",
  "Five more languages: Yoruba, Khmer, Mongolian, Armenian, and Bulgarian — 55 languages total. Third batch under the daily cadence, extending West Africa, Southeast Asia, Central Asia/the Caucasus, and the Balkans.": "Ýene bäş dil: ýoruba, khmer, mongol, ermeni we bolgar dilleri — jemi 55 dil. Gündelik depginiň astyndaky üçünji topar, Günbatar Afrikany, Günorta-Gündogar Aziýany, Merkezi Aziýa/Kawkazy we Balkanlary giňeldýär.",
  "Fixed: switching pages or the per-page setting on /topics didn’t always show the new cards until a manual refresh. Cards beyond page 1 start hidden, so the site’s one-time scroll-reveal animation never had a chance to run on them; paging now forces those cards visible directly instead of waiting on an animation that already missed its moment.": "Düzedildi: /topics sahypasynda sahypalary üýtgetmek ýa-da sahypa başyna sany sazlamasy täze kartlary elde täzeden ýüklemezden görkezmeýärdi. 1-nji sahypadan aňyrdaky kartlar başda gizlin bolýar, şonuň üçin sahypanyň bir gezeklik aýlanyp-görkeziş animasiýasy olarda hiç haçan işlemäge mümkinçilik tapmady; sahypalama indi pursatyny eýýäm sypdyran animasiýa garaşmagyň deregine, şol kartlary göni görnükli edýär.",
  "Fonts": "Şriftler",
  "For machine-readable licensing inquiries, see the contact field in /.well-known/aicl.json.": "Maşyn tarapyndan okalýan ygtyýarnamalandyryş soraglary üçin /.well-known/aicl.json faýlyndaky habarlaşma meýdanyna serediň.",
  "Formal categorization is deferred until there is enough real content to know what the categories should actually be, rather than guessing upfront.": "Resmi kategoriýalaşdyrma, öňünden çaklamagyň deregine, kategoriýalaryň hakykatdan hem näme bolmalydygyny bilmek üçin ýeterlik hakyky mazmun bolýança yza süýşürilýär.",
  "Four files prefilled for that domain — drop them into the site root to declare its AI policy. Fine-tune them in the generator tabs.": "Şol domen üçin öňünden dolduryldylan dört faýl — olaryň emeli intellekt syýasatyny deklarirlemek üçin sahypanyň kök ugruna ýerleşdiriň. Olary generator sahypajyklarynda inçe sazlaň.",
  "Four more entries to reach 18 total, giving the new pagination something real to page through. Newest-first by publication date stays the default sort; other sort options are a later addition.": "Jemi 18-e ýetmek üçin ýene dört ýazgy, täze sahypalama arkaly geçmek üçin hakyky bir zat berýär. Neşir senesi boýunça iň täzeden başlamak standart tertip bolup galýar; beýleki tertip görnüşleri soňra goşulýar.",
  "Four open drafts that form the rights and licensing layer of an AI-readable web: AICR declares rights, AICL executes licensing, AIRS defines the spectrum, AILP governs learning.": "Emeli intellekt tarapyndan okalýan webiň hukuk we ygtyýarnamalandyryş gatlagyny emele getirýän dört açyk taslama: AICR hukuklary deklarirleýär, AICL ygtyýarnamalandyrmany ýerine ýetirýär, AIRS spektri kesgitleýär, AILP öwrenmegi dolandyrýar.",
  "Four protocol drafts published: AICR, AICL, AIRS, AILP — each with definition, scope, JSON example, limitations, and JSON Schema.": "Dört protokol taslamasy çap edildi: AICR, AICL, AIRS, AILP — her biri kesgitleme, gerim, JSON mysaly, çäklendirmeler we JSON Shemasy bilen.",
  "Free for research use with retention limits; any commercial use requires contact. Useful for academic sites and datasets.": "Saklama çäklendirmeleri bilen barlag maksatly ulanmak üçin mugt; islendik täjirçilik taýdan ulanmak üçin habarlaşmak gerek. Akademiki sahypalar we maglumat toplumlary üçin peýdaly.",
  "Free read + summarize (attribution)": "Mugt okamak + gysgaça beýan etmek (atribusiýa)",
  "From AI to \"Killer Robots\": UN Chief Issues Urgent Governance Call": "From AI to \"Killer Robots\": UN Chief Issues Urgent Governance Call",
  "From No AI Access to Commercial Redistribution: eight graduated levels, each independently licensable and auditable.": "Elýeterliligiň ýoklugyndan Täjirçilik Taýdan Gaýtadan Ýaýratmaga çenli: sekiz basgançaklaýyn dereje, olaryň her biri aýratynlykda ygtyýarnamalaşdyrylyp we barlanyp bilner.",
  "From robots.txt to llms.txt to rights manifests": "robots.txt-den llms.txt-e, hukuk manifestlerine çenli",
