  "Live demo API on the edge: GET /api/mock/402 returns a real AICL-style HTTP 402 with machine-actionable licensing info; GET /api/crawler-check inspects any site’s machine-readable policy surface. CORS-open; documented in OpenAPI 3.1 at /ai/openapi.json. No payments are processed.": "Ujunda janly demonstrasiýa API-si: GET /api/mock/402 maşyn tarapyndan hereket edip bolýan ygtyýarnama maglumaty bilen hakyky AICL görnüşli HTTP 402 gaýtaryp berýär; GET /api/crawler-check islendik sahypanyň maşyn tarapyndan okalýan syýasat üstüni barlaýar. CORS-a açyk; /ai/openapi.json salgysynda OpenAPI 3.1-de resminamalaşdyrylan. Hiç bir töleg amala aşyrylmaýar.",
