  "Machine-readable declarations published here or generated from these drafts express intent; this site does not guarantee that AI systems, crawlers, or agents will honor them, nor that such declarations carry specific legal weight in any jurisdiction.": "Bu ýerde çap edilen ýa-da bu taslamalardan döredilen maşyn tarapyndan okalýan deklarasiýalar maksady beýan edýär; bu sahypa emeli intellekt ulgamlarynyň, gözleg robotlarynyň ýa-da agentleriň olary hormatlajakdygyna, ýa-da şeýle deklarasiýalaryň islendik hukuk ulgamynda anyk hukuk agramy göterjekdigine kepillik bermeýär.",
  "Machine-readable governance layer deployed: llms.txt, /ai/ manifests, /.well-known/ policies, /schemas/.": "Maşyn tarapyndan okalýan dolandyryş gatlagy ýaýlyma goýberildi: llms.txt, /ai/ manifestleri, /.well-known/ syýasatlary, /schemas/.",
  "Machine-readable layer stays language-neutral; AI systems and crawlers receive English by default. Negotiation is documented in /ai/manifest.json and /llms.txt.": "Maşyn tarapyndan okalýan gatlak dile bagly bolmadyk bolup galýar; emeli intellekt ulgamlary we gözleg robotlary standart görnüşde iňlis dilini alýarlar. Ylalaşyk /ai/manifest.json we /llms.txt faýllarynda resminamalaşdyrylan.",
  "Make each level independently auditable and priceable.": "Her derejäni aýratynlykda barlanyp bilinjek we bahalandyryp bolýan etmek.",
  "Mattioli and colleagues argue that explainable-AI (XAI) tools quietly embed unexamined assumptions about what an \"explanation\" even is — assumptions rooted in centuries-old philosophical debate that most technical papers never surface. They show that small design choices in an XAI method can carry very different philosophical commitments, and call for developers to make those commitments explicit and fit them to context.": "Mattioli we kärdeşleri, düşündirip bolýan emeli intellekt (XAI) gurallarynyň „düşündiriş” diýilýän zadyň näme bolup biljekdigi barada barlanmadyk çaklamalary sessiz ýagdaýda gömýändigini öňe sürýär — bu çaklamalar köp tehniki makalanyň hiç haçan äşgär etmeýän asyrlyk filosofiki jedeline daýanýar. Olar bir XAI usulyndaky kiçijik dizaýn saýlawlarynyň düýpgöter tapawutly filosofiki borçlary göterip biljekdigini görkezýärler we döredijileri şol borçlary açyk etmäge we konteksle laýyklaşdyrmaga çagyrýarlar.",
  "Max excerpt words": "Iň köp bölek sözi",
