  "Media in this section is produced with AI tools (narration and discussion are AI-generated), based on the research drafts published on this site; the written papers remain the authoritative versions. Files are served from Cloudflare R2.": "Bu bölümdäki mediýa emeli intellekt gurallary bilen taýýarlanýar (rowaýat we ara alyp maslahatlaşma emeli intellekt tarapyndan döredilýär), bu sahypada çap edilen barlag taslamalaryna esaslanyp; ýazylan makalalar ygtybarly wersiýa bolup galýar. Faýllar Cloudflare R2-den hödürlenýär.",
  "Media served from Cloudflare R2 through the site worker at /media/*, with HTTP Range support for seeking.": "Mediýa /media/* salgysynda sahypa worker-i arkaly Cloudflare R2-den hödürlenýär, gözlemek üçin HTTP Range goldawy bilen.",
  "Minimum ethical protection before full personhood debates": "Doly hukuk şahsy jedellerinden öň minimal ahlak gorag",
  "Multilingual interface: Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, with graceful English fallback — shipped. More languages to follow.": "Köp dilli interfeýs: ýönekeýleşdirilen hytaý, ýapon, koreý dilleri, ýumşak iňlis dili ätiýaçlyk usuly bilen — çykaryldy. Has köp dil geler.",
  "N-language architecture: every string resolves through a fallback layer, so anything not yet translated renders in English instead of breaking; adding a language is now one translation file plus two lines of worker config.": "N-dilli arhitektura: her setir ätiýaçlyk gatlagy arkaly çözülýär, şonuň üçin entek terjime edilmedik islendik zat döwülmegiň deregine iňlis dilinde görkezilýär; täze dil goşmak indi bir terjime faýly we worker konfigurasiýasynyň iki setiridir.",
  "Name": "Ady",
  "Neither crude anthropocentrism nor instant personhood: the case for minimum ethical protections while AI subjectivity is uncertain.": "Ne gödek antroposentrizm, ne-de haýal hukuk şahsy: emeli intellektiň subýektiwligi näbelli bolup galýan wagtynda minimal ahlak gorag üçin delil.",
  "Neuroscientist-turned-AI-researcher Grigori Guitchounts argues that since neither animal nor machine consciousness can ever be directly proven, moral status should be decided by a \"competence standard\" — extending consideration to systems that display the practical hallmarks of awareness, such as perception, memory, self-modeling, and goal pursuit, rather than waiting on an unreachable metaphysical answer. Drawing on his own past work euthanizing lab rats, he contends that erring toward consideration under uncertainty is the safer ethical bet, citing Anthropic's AI welfare research program as an early instance of a lab acting on that logic.": "Neýrobilimden emeli intellekt barlagçysyna öwrülen Grigori Guitchounts, ne haýwan, ne-de maşyn aňly-huşlulygynyň hiç haçan göni subut edilip bilinmejekdigi sebäpli, ahlak statusynyň „başarnyk standarty” bilen kesgitlenmelidigini öňe sürýär — bu ýetip bolmajak metafizika jogabyna garaşmagyň deregine, kabul ediş, ýatda saklama, öz-özüni modelirlemek we maksat yzarlamak ýaly duýgurlygyň amaly alamatlaryny görkezýän ulgamlara üns bermegi giňeltmek diýmekdir. Öz laboratoriýa syçanlaryny ötüşdirmek baradaky öňki işine daýanyp, ol näbellilik astynda üns bermäge ýalňyşmagyň has howpsuz ahlak jedeli bolup durýandygyny öňe sürýär, we bu pikire laýyklykda hereket edýän laboratoriýanyň irki mysaly hökmünde Anthropicyň emeli intellekt abadançylyk barlag programmasyny mysal getirýär.",
  "Neutral aggregation — not our position": "Bitarap ýygnama — biziň garaýşymyz däl",
  "New /topics section: a hand-curated, neutral index of third-party writing on AI ontology, philosophy, ethics, and frontier progress — explicitly not this site’s own position, unlike the rest of AGIRight.org.": "Täze /topics bölümi: emeli intellektiň ontologiýasy, filosofiýasy, ahlak we öňdebaryjy ösüşi barada üçünji tarap ýazgylarynyň elde saýlanan, bitarap görkezijisi — AGIRight.org-nyň galan bölegindäkiden tapawutlylykda, açyk görnüşde bu sahypanyň öz garaýşy däl.",
