  "Proposes \"Post-AI Ontology\" as a framework for analyzing AI at the level of conditions of being, rather than only its use or social impact — treating AI as a philosophical rupture in what it means to exist alongside non-human minds, not just a new tool.": "Emeli intellekti diňe onuň ulanylyşy ýa-da jemgyýetçilik täsiri derejesinde däl-de, barlyk şertleri derejesinde derňemek üçin çarçuwa hökmünde „Post-AI Ontologiýasyny” teklip edýär — emeli intellekti diňe täze gural hökmünde däl-de, ynsan bolmadyk aňlar bilen bile ýaşamagyň näme aňladýandygynda filosofiki bölünişik hökmünde garaýar.",
