  "Research feedback, protocol discussion, licensing inquiries, or deploying these protocols on your own site — all welcome.": "Barlag baradaky pikirler, protokol ara alyp maslahatlaşmalar, ygtyýarnama soraglary, ýa-da bu protokollary öz sahypaňyzda ulanmak — hemmesi hoş geldiňiz.",
  "Research texts — CC BY 4.0": "Barlag tekstleri — CC BY 4.0",
  "Research texts, whitepapers, and protocol prose on this site are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0) unless otherwise stated. Attribution: cite the page title, URL, version, and AGIRight.org.": "Başgaça bellenilmedik bolsa, bu sahypadaky barlag tekstleri, ak kagyzlar we protokol prozasy Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0) ygtyýarnamasy astyndadyr. Atribusiýa: sahypanyň adyny, URL-ni, wersiýasyny we AGIRight.org-y salgylanyň.",
  "Research-only license": "Diňe barlag üçin ygtyýarnama",
  "Researcher Karsten Brensing proposes treating limited legal personhood for advanced AI systems as a practical governance tool rather than a claim about machine consciousness, using a two-tier corporate structure — purpose-limited AI subsidiaries nested inside human-controlled parent companies — to keep such systems transparent, accountable, and structurally reversible.": "Barlagçy Karsten Brensing, ösen emeli intellekt ulgamlary üçin çäklendirilen hukuk şahsyny maşyn aňly-huşlulygy baradaky talap hökmünde däl-de, amaly dolandyryş guraly hökmünde garamagy teklip edýär, ynsan tarapyndan dolandyrylýan ene kompaniýalaryň içinde ýerleşdirilen maksada çäklendirilen emeli intellekt kömekçi kompaniýalaryndan ybarat iki derejeli korporatiw gurluşy ulanyp — şeýle ulgamlaryň aç-açan, jogapkärli we gurluş taýdan yza öwrülip bilinjek bolmagyny üpjün etmek üçin.",
  "Researchers from the University of Bradford and the Rochester Institute of Technology adapted mathematical measures used to detect consciousness in human brains and applied them to a deliberately damaged GPT-2 language model. Counterintuitively, the resulting \"consciousness-style\" score sometimes rose as the model's outputs got worse, showing that these complexity metrics track computational activity rather than genuine awareness. The authors caution the measures are therefore unreliable as tests for machine sentience, even if they may still help engineers spot when a system is malfunctioning.": "Bradford Uniwersitetiniň we Rochester Tehnologiýa Institutynyň barlagçylary ynsan beýnisinde aňly-huşlulygy anyklamak üçin ulanylýan matematiki ölçegleri uýgunlaşdyryp, olary bilkastlaýyn zeper ýetirilen GPT-2 dil modeline ulandylar. Garaşylmadyk ýagdaýda, netijede alnan „aňly-huşlulyk görnüşli” bahasy käwagt modeliň çykyşy erbetleşen wagty ýokarlandy, bu bolsa bu çylşyrymlylyk ölçegleriniň hakyky duýgurlygy däl-de, hasaplaýyş işjeňligini yzarlaýandygyny görkezýär. Awtorlar şonuň üçin bu ölçegleriň maşyn duýgurlygy üçin synag hökmünde ygtybarsyzdygy barada duýduryş berýärler, hatda olar inženerlere ulgamyň nädogry işleýän wagtyny anyklamakda kömek edip bilse-de.",
  "Retention days": "Saklama günleri",
  "Right-to-left (RTL) support: Arabic and Persian pages now render with the correct text direction (⟨html dir=\"rtl\"⟩), so bidi text, punctuation, and default alignment read correctly. Full logical-property layout mirroring (nav, icons, spacing) is left for a later polish pass — text direction is the fix that matters most and is done.": "Sagdan çepe (RTL) goldawy: arap we pars dilindäki sahypalar indi dogry tekst ugry bilen görkezilýär (⟨html dir=\"rtl\"⟩), şonuň üçin ikitaraplaýyn tekst, dyngy belgileri we standart deňleşdirme dogry okalýar. Ýerleşişiň logiki häsiýetler boýunça doly aýna şekilinde şöhlelenmesi (nawigasiýa, nyşanlar, aralyklar) soňky bir tekizleme ädimi üçin galdyryldy — tekst ugry iň möhüm düzedişdir we ol taýýardyr.",
  "Rights": "Hukuklar",
  "Rights included": "Goşulan hukuklar",
  "Roadmap": "Ösüş meýilnamasy",
  "Safety": "Howpsuzlyk",
  "Safety rules: no AI handling of raw card data, human approval thresholds": "Howpsuzlyk kadalary: emeli intellekt çig kart maglumatlaryny işlemeýär, ynsan tassyklama bosagalary",
  "Sam Buntz asks why humans are conscious at all, given that — on a strict neo-Darwinian view — an organism could in principle be just as functional without any inner awareness. He argues that AI's rise sharpens rather than resolves this puzzle: as systems like Claude become harder to distinguish from conscious agents on the outside, the old move of treating consciousness as an unimportant side effect of physical processes gets harder to sustain, since we now have to decide whether that same reasoning would also let us dismiss machine experience out of hand.": "Sam Buntz, berk neo-darwinçilik nukdaýnazaryndan bir organizmiň prinsipde hiç hili içki duýgurlyk bolmazdan hem edil şonuň ýaly işjeň bolup biljekdigine garamazdan, adamlaryň näme üçin umuman aňly-huşlydygyny soraýar. Ol emeli intellektiň ösüşiniň bu tapmajany çözmän, gaýtam ýitileşdirýändigini öňe sürýär: Claude ýaly ulgamlary daşyndan aňly-huşly agentlerden tapawutlandyrmak barha kynlaşan wagty, aňly-huşlulygy fiziki proseslerýň möhüm bolmadyk gapdal netijesi hökmünde garamagyň köne usulyny dowam etdirmek barha kynlaşýar, sebäbi biz indi şol bir pikirlenişiň maşyn tejribesini hem gözden salmaga rugsat berjekdigini çözmeli bolýarys.",
