  "Seven copy-paste-ready machine-readable policy examples — from a minimal AICR declaration to a pay-per-crawl style HTTP 402 response. Use the playground to generate your own.": "Göçürip ýapyşmaga taýyn ýedi maşyn tarapyndan okalýan syýasat mysaly — minimal AICR deklarasiýasyndan pay-per-crawl görnüşli HTTP 402 jogabyna çenli. Öz mysalyňyzy döretmek üçin playground-y ulanyň.",
