  "Six interconnected research areas, from AI rights and content licensing to machine-readable governance and democratic AI network economics.": "Emeli intellekt hukuklaryndan we mazmun ygtyýarnamalandyrylyşyndan başlap, maşyn tarapyndan okalýan dolandyryşa we demokratik emeli intellekt tor ykdysadyýetine çenli, özara baglanyşykly alty barlag ugry.",
  "Six research whitepapers published under CC BY 4.0.": "CC BY 4.0 astynda çap edilen alty barlag ak kagyzy.",
  "Six seed entries to start, each fetched and confirmed live before being added, with an original paraphrase (not an excerpt) and a link to the actual source. No crawler or automated sourcing yet — that is a later phase.": "Başlangyç üçin alty ýazgy, olaryň her biri goşulmazdan öň alynýar we janly görnüşde tassyklanýar, asyl parafraza bilen (bölek däl) we hakyky çeşmä baglanyşyk bilen. Heniz gözleg roboty ýa-da awtomatiki çeşme gözlegi ýok — bu soňraky tapgyrdyr.",
