  "Specs are labeled Draft → Experimental → Proposal → Stable; everything is currently Draft v0.1. Fields and semantics may change before v1.0; breaking changes will be recorded in a changelog.": "Spesifikasiýalar Taslama → Eksperimental → Teklip → Durnukly diýlip bellenýär; häzirki wagtda ähli zat Taslama v0.1 ýagdaýynda. Meýdanlar we manylar v1.0-dan öň üýtgäp biler; kesgin üýtgeşmeler üýtgeşmeler žurnalynda ýazgy ediler.",
  "Stable protocol specs, full bilingual site, developer documentation, community feedback loop.": "Durnukly protokol spesifikasiýalary, doly iki dilli sahypa, döredijiler üçin resminamalar, jemgyýet pikir aýlanyşy.",
  "Standardize the machine-to-machine flow: discover policy → request quote → license → use → audit.": "Maşyndan-maşyna akymy standartlaşdyrmak: syýasaty açmak → baha soramak → ygtyýarnamalandyrmak → ulanmak → barlamak.",
  "Static research site, four protocol drafts, machine-readable layer, whitepapers — shipped 2026-07-04.": "Statik barlag sahypasy, dört protokol taslamasy, maşyn tarapyndan okalýan gatlak, ak kagyzlar — 2026-07-04-de çykaryldy.",
