  "Studio section: four videos and two long-form audio discussions accompanying the protocols and papers (AI-assisted production; the written papers remain authoritative).": "Studio bölümi: protokollara we makalalara goşulýan dört wideo we iki uzyn ses söhbetdeşligi (emeli intellekt kömegi bilen taýýarlanan; ýazylan makalalar ygtybarly bolup galýar).",
  "Subjective Experience in AI Systems: What Do AI Researchers and the Public Believe?": "Subjective Experience in AI Systems: What Do AI Researchers and the Public Believe?",
