  "Three more /topics entries (25 total): a study on why complexity-based \"consciousness scores\" are unreliable for AI, an essay proposing a competence-based standard for machine moral status, and an explainer on the EU AI Act's split compliance timeline after the July 2026 Digital Omnibus amendment.": "Ýene üç /topics ýazgysy (jemi 25): çylşyrymlylyga esaslanan „aňly-huşlulyk bahalarynyň” emeli intellekt üçin näme üçin ygtybarsyzdygy barada barlag, maşyn ahlak statusy üçin başarnyga esaslanan standart teklip edýän oçerk, we 2026-njy ýylyň iýul aýyndaky Sanly Omnibus üýtgetmesinden soň EI Emeli Intellekt Aktynyň bölünen laýyklyk tertibi barada düşündiriş.",
  "Three more /topics entries (28 total): China's new international AI ethics governance action plan (unveiled at WAIC 2026 in Shanghai), an essay on whether AI could be conscious and what that would mean ethically, and a paper reviewing the case against granting AI systems legal personhood.": "Ýene üç /topics ýazgysy (jemi 28): Hytaýyň täze halkara emeli intellekt ahlak dolandyryşy hereket meýilnamasy (Şanhaýda WAIC 2026-da äşgär edildi), emeli intellektiň aňly-huşly bolup biljekdigi we munuň ahlak taýdan näme aňladýandygy barada oçerk, we emeli intellekt ulgamlaryna hukuk şahsy bermäge garşy delilleri gözden geçirýän makala.",
